# Phase 4, GA-11-1's recheck (2026-10-14): the Gini's redistribution anchor re-taken where F4-5 re-seeds the income lever. The repro and its areas'
# runs - area 11 (thirty years, every country idle, Sweden and Germany under fuzz) and area 7 (society: three years at each pole, a decade idle).
# The measure is the Gini itself: France 30.00 -> 32.03 in thirty years, the USA 39.50 -> 40.87, Germany and Poland about a point before the fix;
# Italy (never re-seeded) is the control.
#
# --- area 11 (Tools/audit/area11_thirty.plan, unchanged) ---
